    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i messed up so bad at work. i think i ruined everything. a mistake in my calculations... people actually got hurt because of it. i can't even look at myself in the mirror anymore. i feel like i'm just a bad person at my core now, like there's no way to fix what i've done.",
